{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It\u2019s the 90s. To make rent, you\u2019ve taken a night job at a butcher shop. Once the sun sets, the store is in your hands.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651880/extras/0138951c328f33133f08a91f1711ad23.poster.avif?t=1770834156\" width=400 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651880/extras/0138951c328f33133f08a91f1711ad23.webm?t=1770834156\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651880/extras/0138951c328f33133f08a91f1711ad23.mp4?t=1770834156\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prepare meat for customers, manage the shop, and begin uncovering the dark secrets hidden behind this seemingly ordinary job.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651880/extras/3cd9f9e39f2300290821bb06f5a867e1.poster.avif?t=1770834156\" width=400 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651880/extras/3cd9f9e39f2300290821bb06f5a867e1.webm?t=1770834156\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651880/extras/3cd9f9e39f2300290821bb06f5a867e1.mp4?t=1770834156\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Be careful as you confront both yourself and the shop\u2019s past. In the silence of the night, you never know what might be watching you.</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/st